<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.21" extension="2015-08-01"/>
    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 16 minutes, with his consent. After his kidney illness he wanted to talk about what would happen if he were ever too ill to speak for himself. He named a trusted friend as his health care agent, and a health care proxy form was completed; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. He said that what matters most to him is being able to compose and perform, and that he wants to be told plainly how ill he is. He chose not to record specific treatment preferences today. The plan will be revisited yearly or after any serious illness. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
